<title>JAPAN: Rapid forex changes unfavourable - Japan spokesman.</title>
<headline>Rapid forex changes unfavourable - Japan spokesman.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan does not want to see rapid fluctuations in foreign exchange rates, Chief Cabinet Secretary Seiroku Kajiyama told reporters on Thursday.  </p>
<p>&quot;Rapid changes in foreign exchange rates are unfavourable,&quot; Kajiyama told a regular news conference.</p>
</text>
